:"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-06T18:34:53-07:00","id":1379122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1378781-how-has-pentex-and-the-other-people-reacted-to-covid-and-the-quarantine?p=1378822#post1378822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">SARS-COV-2 definitely wouldn't be something made by Gaia. It was by mankind deliberately. It isn't natural. Most likely something a Nephandi scientist released.</div> </div> </div> </div>While this board doesn't have rpg.net's policy on conspiracy theories, I can't see any good from spreading this variety of origin tale. Especially when bats have some highly sophisticated immune systems due to being able to actively fly, with strong anti-viral measures in particular. Zoonotic viruses from bats are going to hit other mammals hard; in contrast, they have a harder time with fungal infections like white nose syndrome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}